entries[1248529] = { ["name"] = "Adding", ["text"] = "1.5 sec cast\nReagents:\nMantle of Stars\nWhen any party member's health falls below 40 % during combat, the mantle grants them an absorb shield equal to 35 % of their maximum health.\n\nEnemies near the shielded ally and active companion are knocked up and take 10 % more damage for 6 sec.\n\nCan only occur every 1.5 min.\n\nUse: Add this Curio to your companion's collection." }
