entries[1248552] = { ["name"] = "Adding", ["text"] = "1.5 sec cast\nReagents:\nSanctum's Edict\nYour companion has a chance to gain Sanctum's Blessings through combat, as well as by slaying foes. Elite enemies grant 5 , while normal foes yield 1 .\n\nEach blessing grants 1 % increased healing and damage. Upon reaching 15 , your companion converts 30 % of their current health into an absorb shield that increases blessing bonuses while active.\n\nUse: Add this Curio to your companion's collection." }
